  "instructions": [
    "Marinate the chicken in yogurt, lemon juice, garam masala, cumin powder, and coriander powder for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Heat oil in a pan over medium-high heat and grill the chicken until browned and cooked through.",
    "In the same pan, add onion, ginger, cinnamon, cardamom, and cayenne pepper and sauté until the onion is translucent.",
